rom 1951 to 2025 on its 6 grids. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, January to February and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 38 years. In 2025 the middle got 180% of normal in June to July and 26% in November to December. Grid 25326 had its driest year in 2012 at 52%, and its preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 is 170.9.</p>"}
